+datasets, a separately seeded test at the generating scale included it in
+13, 15, and 15 of 16, respectively. In 10 datasets, the direct test
+included the generating scale and the returned set excluded it. This
+paired comparison reflects both grid resolution and the finite number of
+draws in each run. In the interior scenario the decisions differed in 7 of
+16 datasets (exact 95% interval 0.198 to 0.701). Each interior set had one
+component and only two or three accepted nodes.
+
+Removing nodes and keeping the 99-draw decisions at the shared nodes gave
+coverage of 1, 14, and 5 of 16 for these datasets. The fine grid used nine
